---
// Section 06: The Office — Let's Begin a Conversation
// Replaces traditional sales forms with a warm, human, architectural invitation into dialogue.
---

<section 
  id="office" 
  class="relative py-24 sm:py-32 lg:py-40 px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-12 bg-brand-black"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    
    <!-- Chapter Header -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 pb-16 border-b border-brand-border/40">
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400 space-y-1">
        <span class="block tracking-widest uppercase text-[11px] font-medium text-neutral-400">Chapter 06</span>
        <h2 class="text-white text-base font-medium font-sans">The Office & Studio</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-8">
        <p class="font-serif italic text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-white leading-[1.05]">
          Let’s Begin a Conversation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Office & Dialogue Layout -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 pt-16 items-start">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Welcoming Narrative -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8 font-sans font-light text-neutral-300 text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed">
        
        <p class="font-serif italic text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-neutral-100">
          "We don’t believe in automated contact forms or lead scoring scripts. We believe in human conversation."
        </p>

        <p>
          Whether you are a founder preparing to launch a new enterprise, a heritage practice needing to restore clarity to your story, or an architectural studio seeking creative direction—our door is open.
        </p>

        <p>
          We welcome visitors to our studio in Calicut for tea, quiet reading, and unhurried dialogue. If you are far away, write to us as you would write to a friend who shares your respect for craft.
        </p>

        <!-- Direct Email Focus Card -->
        <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 border border-brand-border bg-brand-surface rounded-sm space-y-6">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-widest">
            Direct Correspondence
          </div>
          
          <a 
            href="mailto:hello@closecommunications.com" 
            class="block font-serif italic text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white hover:text-neutral-300 transition-colors underline decoration-neutral-600 underline-offset-8"
          >
            hello@closecommunications.com
          </a>

          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            We review every letter personally. You will hear back from Brand Learner within two business days.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Physical Studio Details & Atmosphere -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-8">
        
        <div class="border border-brand-border/80 bg-brand-surface/60 p-8 rounded-sm space-y-6 font-mono text-xs">
          
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <span class="text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px]">Physical Studio Address</span>
            <h3 class="font-serif italic text-2xl text-white font-normal">Silk Street Sanctuary</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
              Close Communications<br />
              Beach Road, Silk Street<br />
              Kozhikode (Calicut) 673001<br />
              Kerala, India
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2 pt-4 border-t border-brand-border/60">
            <span class="text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px]">Atmosphere & Protocol</span>
            <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed text-[11px]">
              Studio visits are by appointment only to ensure dedicated quiet time for each conversation. Fresh pour-over coffee and local Malabar tea are served.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2 pt-4 border-t border-brand-border/60">
            <span class="text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px]">Time Zone & Coordinates</span>
            <p class="text-neutral-400 text-[11px]">
              11.2588° N, 75.7804° E &bull; IST (UTC +5:30)
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Studio Photography Image -->
        <div class="relative aspect-[16/10] border border-brand-border/80 rounded-sm overflow-hidden">
          <img 
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366216548-37526070297c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" 
            alt="Quiet architectural studio workspace with warm natural sunlight"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale contrast-125 opacity-80"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
